      "content": "Before performing the full weight reset, meticulously map the functional dependency paths from the input features directly to the phase classification output. Identify the minimal set of parameters—even if they are few—that retain this path without requiring the complex, specialized heuristics. This targeted re-introduction strategy demonstrates transparency while minimizing the disruption to the core predictive circuitry. Document this process thoroughly to show that the resurrected model is the smallest functional remnant capable of achieving the targeted topological discovery.",
